#: includes/AdminSettings.php:54
msgid "General Banner Settings"
msgstr "Allgemeine Banner-Einstellungen"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:61
msgid "Banner Title"
msgstr "Banner-Titel"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:65
msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Wir schätzen Ihre Privatsphäre"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:70
msgid "Banner Text"
msgstr "Banner-Text"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:76
msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized ads "
"or content, and analyze our traffic. By clicking \"Accept All\", you consent "
"to our use of cookies."
msgstr ""
"Wir verwenden Cookies, um Ihr Surferlebnis zu verbessern, personalisierte "
"Werbung oder Inhalte bereitzustellen und unseren Datenverkehr zu "
"analysieren. Indem Sie auf „Alle akzeptieren“ klicken, stimmen Sie der "
"Verwendung von Cookies zu."

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:82
msgid "Accept Button Label"
msgstr "Beschriftung der Schaltfläche „Akzeptieren“"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:86
msgid "Accept All"
msgstr "Alle akzeptieren"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:91
msgid "Reject Button Label"
msgstr "Beschriftung der Schaltfläche „Ablehnen“"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:95
