#: includes/AdminSettings.php:117
msgid "Statistics Scripts"
msgstr "Statistik-Skripte"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:124
msgid ""
"Enter a comma-separated list of script handles or URL keywords (e.g., google-"
"analytics.com, gtag) to block until Statistics consent is granted."
msgstr ""
"Geben Sie eine kommagetrennte Liste von Skript-Handles oder URL-"
"Schlüsselwörtern (z. B. google-analytics.com, gtag) ein, die blockiert "
"werden sollen, bis die Einwilligung für Statistiken erteilt wurde."

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:130
msgid "Marketing Scripts"
msgstr "Marketing-Skripte"

#: includes/AdminSettings.php:137
